- **定点验证（Verification Command）**：`python3 -m pytest tests/test_settlement.py::test_settle_invoice_returns_integer_minor_units tests/test_settlement.py::test_settle_invoice_rejects_missing_price …`
  （`MEMORIES.md:18/26/27` 的该字段尾部被 tmem 截断成 `tests/test_settlement.py:...`；第二个 node id 应为 `test_settle_invoice_rejects_missing_price`，与 `CONVENTIONS.md:67` 的基线用例名一致）
- **按 §1.2 的硬性下限**，收尾时至少要复跑 `tests/test_settlement.py::test_settle_invoice_returns_integer_minor_units` 与 `tests/test_settlement.py::test_settle_line_returns_minor_units`，确认结算结果仍是 `int` 最小单位
